rooms_desc ({"Welcome to Bladecutter's house!If you knew Bladecutter from 2 years ago, then you might remember most of the house.But if you have just met him recently, then you're in for a treat.This is the Central hallway, and leads to the various other rooms in his houseNorth is the kitchen, east is the wreck/pool room, and to the west behindclosed and locked doors is the master bedroom.Hope you like it here. And let me know if you have any opinions, questions,or comments on my room descriptionsIan.","You have entered a not-so-cramped kitchen, filled with wonderful devicesthat make using it that much easier. There's the Magic Microwave, whichhas a special talent of holding anything you want in it. There's the large, white stove, which is both gas and electric (don't ask).  There's the huge sink, which holds most of his dishes, while the dishwasherholds the rest. A table sits in the middle of the room, with 4 chairs surrounding it. And a really large fridge.","In here you see a massive room, filled with stuff including a 40 inch tva long ebony table, Super Nintendo, Sega Genisis, an IBM. A Pool Table ]takes up one side of the room, while the pool takes up the other.A large couch just made for necking is here."," Now you know where Blade hides from everyone when he isn't in the moodfor people contact.  The collection of cars is amazing.  And all are ready to be taken out on the track!  The Garage is filled with tools, tthat are scattered in various tool boxes every where you look.  The onecar that really catches your eye is the sleek, Metallic Midnight Blue81 Grand Prix in the corner of the shop.  Lowered just enough, and witha set of vulcanized meats that seem like the perfect size, you desire a ride in this beast first.  Then your eyes start wandering across theother cars... Porche, Corvette, Camaro, Lotus, Ferarri, Firebird, andeven a Cougar are all here, for you to look at.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This Living Room is about the same size as the Reck room, but is a bit morerelaxing. You see a large fireplace on the north wall, and a huge couch on the east, which looks comfortable. You wonder what it's used for. You alsowonder how he keeps a white carpet so spotless. A stereo system adorns the west wall, lending a romantic mood on occasions.","You have walked out of the house, onto an elevated deck, and are blastedwith a warm sea breeze that feels nice to the touch.  As you breath in the sweet air, you relax as the sounds of the calm sea lap up against theshore. The sun hangs low over the distant western sky, indicating that the day is coming to an end.  You wish that you were with your loved one rightnow, for a quick kiss in the romantic half-light.  As you look around, you see the sand reflecting the blazing sun, making the shore look as if it's on fire.  You can't wait until the sun is gone, so that you can gofor a nice moonlight walk on the beach.  Your heart throbs as you thinkof a long passionate kiss with your special someone.  You notice seagullssoaring in the distant sky, searching the water for a snack.  On the shore, you notice various shapes of seashells, half buried in the sand.","You have entered Bladecutter's master bedroom, and are amazed at everythingthat he's crammed in here.First there is the queen size bed, and the sheets look like they were just put on. Then you notice the night tables on each side of the bed.Looking around, you see the two oak dressers, one with a jewelry box.To the north is the bathroom, and sooner or later,I'll get around to decorating this room better...Unfortunately, I'm not the same person I was 2 years ago when I coded the rest of this house. I wish I was, but things have happened, and I can'tsee the beauty of things that I saw 2 years ago.",0,0,})
rooms_short ({"The central Hallway","The Kitchen. ","The Reck room, please refrain from recking it...","Bladecutter's Garage. And Racetrack.","A brand new room, ready to be decorated","The Living Room, and a really white carpet.","Ocean Side view.","Master bedroom.",0,0,})
