items ({({"picture","A group photo including Shamrock, Shamus, Nike, and Rossi making a face",}),0,0,({"racetrack","You choose the oval over the drag strip and attempt to max the cars!","","","Prix","My pride and joy. And a real scream to drive. Ask him for a ride.","race prix","You jump in and stap down! The motor screams as you approach 170!","corvette","One of his toys. You love the way it handles around 150, but it needs more.","porche","A hot little blue 911. You wonder why he doesn't take it out more...","Camaro","You just found the reason why he doesn't take the Porche out! FAST!!!","ferarri","A black Testerossa convirtible. You find out that it only does 183!","cougar","Blade doesn't like Fords, but he couldn't resist this car! Handles good.",}),0,0,({"sun","The sun has finished setting... Care for going for a little walk?","seashells","You dig a fully intact shell out of the ground, and put it to your ear.","seagulls","The seagulls dive into the water, emerging with a large fish dinner.",}),0,0,0,})
